# Streamclone naming (not twitch-7tv-clone)

- **Product / GitHub repo:** **Streamclone** (`Aron-Chu/streamclone`). Use this in commit bodies, PR text, user replies, and bug-fix notes.
- **Local git folder** may still be named `twitch-7tv-clone` on disk — legacy checkout path only. Do not refer to the product or repo as "twitch-7tv-clone" in docs or chat.
- **`%USERPROFILE%\streamclone`** is the **release install** (Setup.exe / ZIP), not this source repo. Bug fixes must be committed **here** and pushed; copying scripts only into the install folder does not ship to others.

After each **install / desktop / bootstrap / uninstall** bug fix, append one row to the table in [`docs/repo-maintenance.md`](../docs/repo-maintenance.md) (*Install bug fix log*).
